            "name": "Does QLED mean a Toshiba has no backlight?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. QLED is an LCD-based display with quantum-dot technology and still uses illumination behind the image. It should not be confused with self-emissive OLED, which has a different diagnostic path."
